      "statement": "OpenProjectApiClient is the central service translating MCP tool operations into OpenProject REST API calls. It delegates HTTP requests to OpenProjectRestOperations, which creates a per-request RestClient via OpenProjectRestClientFactory with the current connection's base URL and auth header. All API communication uses application/hal+json content type.",
